       The ggeettggrrnnaamm() function returns a pointer to a structure containing the
       broken‐out  fields of the record in the group database (e.g., the local
       group file _/_e_t_c_/_g_r_o_u_p, NIS, and LDAP) that matches the group name _n_a_m_e.

       The ggeettggrrggiidd() function returns a pointer to a structure containing the
       broken‐out fields of the record in the group database that matches  the
